<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge T-bills July 7.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge T-bills July 7.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge ($7.9 million) of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on July 7, the National Bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K0801980</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     July 7</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Jan 8, 1998</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410 $1=75.7040 tenge</p>
</text>
